translate chinese yuri_exclusive_1_dc851a35:

    # y 1m "She gets targeted by these people who escaped from a human experiment prison..."
    y 1m "她成了一群从人体实验监狱逃出来的人的目标……"

# script-exclusives-yuri.rpyc:52
translate chinese yuri_exclusive_1_8908c88c:

    # y "And while her life is in danger, she needs to desperately choose who to trust."
    y "在生命受到威胁的同时，她还得拼命选择该信任谁。"

