translate chinese yuri_exclusive_1_5af42571:

    # y 1i "No matter what she does, she ends up destroying most of her relationships and her life starts to fall apart..."
    y 1i "无论她怎么做，最终都会毁掉大部分人际关系，生活开始分崩离析……"

